  "interpretation": {
    "primary_route_result": "Continuous plant-level mismatch-to-robbery rank association is invariant to constant reach scaling and remains positive.",
    "binary_route_result": "Paired plant-level robbery contrast strengthens as the barrier is restricted to more severe effective-reach mismatch.",
    "participation_result": "The culmen-only no-filtering conclusion is not robust to literature-motivated tongue-reach correction. At 4/3 and 1.8, pooled and legitimate feeding are reduced under the redefined barrier while robbery-only counts remain statistically unresolved.",
    "relative_route_result": "At the 1.8 multiplier, robbery is retained relative to legitimate feeding (RR ratio 5.31, 95% plant-jackknife CI 1.92-14.67), aligning the zero-inclusive model with the positive route-composition result.",
    "threshold_result": "Constant reach scaling only translates mismatch and the fitted/search boundary together. The preregistered threshold remains boundary-limited and does not become an interior localized threshold."
